@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Portfolio del usuario del seed
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/portfolio

### Buscar por ticker o nombre
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?q=YPF&limit=20&offset=0

### Compra MARKET; repetir la misma clave y cuerpo devuelve la orden original
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-market-buy-001

{"instrumentId":47,"side":"BUY","type":"MARKET","size":1}

### Compra LIMIT por presupuesto
# @name limitOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-limit-buy-001

{"instrumentId":47,"side":"BUY","type":"LIMIT","amount":"2000.00","price":"900.00"}

### Consultar estado de la orden LIMIT
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/orders/{{limitOrder.response.body.id}}

### Cancelar orden LIMIT
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/1/orders/{{limitOrder.response.body.id}}/cancel

### Venta MARKET
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-market-sell-001

{"instrumentId":47,"side":"SELL","type":"MARKET","size":1}
